On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Go visit Bros."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Go visit Seis."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Now we can only move forward. We're almost done with sealing all the devils."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We've found the hidden hell. They say that there are [Devil13] Beleth and [Devil37] Phenex, [Devil61] Zagan.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [13Devil] Beleth, [37Devil] Phenex, and [61Devil] Zagan."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Now we can only move forward. We're almost done with sealing all the devils."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We've found the hidden hell. They say that there are [Devil13] Beleth and [Devil37] Phenex, [Devil61] Zagan.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [13Devil] Beleth, [37Devil] Phenex, and [61Devil] Zagan."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "You aren't done? I'll send you there again."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You aren't done with sealing? I'll send you there again."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "You are done sealing! You did seal all 71 Devils."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "You are done! Now we've all sealed 71 Devils."

On completed
    Say "Now it's the last mission. There's [Devil1] The Boss Bael. With the sealing of this boss the war will end. With the [Devil1 Summoning Scroll] find [Devil1 Summoning Stone] and summon him."
